                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "внешним видом, физическими свойствами напоминающий желе"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac384d2e-9919-463c-ad08-bae5d6201ba1",
                                "sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                                "text": "Течения занесли сюда желеобразные образования из нефти, сотни тысяч пакетов, ящиков, прочего мусора."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00a28dba-3dfa-427e-8d5b-9cfe631b8d13",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "jelly-like",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cf4f6a6-d349-4eaf-9a19-730ed2bbd0c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "jellylike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jellylike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bc106b2-d56a-3314-b40c-41a9fffe56b2",
                                        "entry_id": "677b8490-3904-3ed2-a3bf-aec9e4c16a81",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or characteristic of jelly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "391ae919-b68b-46e6-aad5-225669416a0e",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc106b2-d56a-3314-b40c-41a9fffe56b2",
                                                "text": "1895, Mark Twain, “How to Tell a Story,” in Tales, Speeches, Essays, and Sketches, edited by Tom Quirk, Penguin, 1994, originally published in The Youth’s Companion, 3 October, 1895,\nThe teller is innocent and happy and pleased with himself, and has to stop every little while to hold himself in and keep from laughing outright; and does hold in, but his body quakes in a jelly-like way with interior chuckles; and at the end of the ten minutes the audience have laughed until they are exhausted, and the tears are running down their faces."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdb40c6a-4fba-4f01-877e-fc816d783ccd",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc106b2-d56a-3314-b40c-41a9fffe56b2",
                                                "text": "However quickly the water was used, there were always larvae of some sort on its surface, jumpy jellylike whiskery things, perfection in their way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5202b56-8265-451e-90c8-913e1820efed",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "geloideo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4d80953-8052-41fd-8dfa-68f2667800ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "gallertartig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gallertartig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "727f856b-8a6d-3e3a-9b54-824974cd7e1a",
                                        "entry_id": "f774436d-6f10-3d17-891d-01483a78c46f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "von geleeartiger Konsistenz"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e326908-7e17-4f48-bbb5-e3268d415a84",
                                                "sense_id": "727f856b-8a6d-3e3a-9b54-824974cd7e1a",
                                                "text": "Eine Greisin mit einem Eikopf und gallertartigem Wackelkinn saß auf dem Kamelrittapparat und hupste, daß ihr die Zähne wie weiße Bohnen aus dem Munde flogen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a0acfb2d-ba8d-4862-a33f-66bfe0c82797",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "geleeartig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geleeartig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffef6798-9a54-3819-bce7-e5bf10a6ce8b",
                                        "entry_id": "c681d4c9-b88c-307a-83f5-8b5899f1933e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gelee ähnelnd, an Gelee erinnernd"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cf9efa-b129-4b85-9b7b-ca59c4b9ebb5",
                                                "sense_id": "ffef6798-9a54-3819-bce7-e5bf10a6ce8b",
                                                "text": "„Das Gas traf mit solcher Wucht auf seine Nerven, dass seine Beine zu zucken begannen und er dem Insekt einen Tritt in das große geleeartige Auge versetzte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "583fbd6e-950d-4de9-8ffe-1e3e841c5dd2",
                                                "sense_id": "ffef6798-9a54-3819-bce7-e5bf10a6ce8b",
                                                "text": "„Obwohl Marks mit Ausnahme seiner Handfläche offenbar keine schweren Verbrennungen erlitten hatte, tauchten sie ihn vorsichtshalber in eine mit geleeartiger Peroxidol-Brandsalbe gefüllte Wanne.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11d8dd65-d9e0-41a4-aeca-097625657d52",
                                                "sense_id": "ffef6798-9a54-3819-bce7-e5bf10a6ce8b",
                                                "text": "„Der Speisesaal ist durch zwei bemerkenswert dicke Panzerglasplatten vor Lärm, Wasser, Wind und heißem, fliegendem Blei geschützt, und der Zwischenraum zwischen diesen Platten mit etwas Kühlem, Geleeartigem gefüllt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4db95342-9b03-43d5-bd14-cac1578681c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "6faf4edf-24db-38e4-a202-51e06ec74f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ae77bf-7056-39a7-a1a5-7a4284c31aa9",
                        "target_lang_word": "gélatineux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gélatineux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd9f1446-96dd-3f1e-85dd-24ad02bba266",
                                        "entry_id": "64a552d6-935a-329e-9d6f-54657419a01a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est de la nature de la gélatine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "388b0215-4d9e-43a9-b302-28da2d26e518",
                                                "sense_id": "dd9f1446-96dd-3f1e-85dd-24ad02bba266",
                                                "text": "Thunherg présume que cette dernière en tire les matériaux d'espèces de fucus, notamment du fucus bursa, qui, suivant lui, est aussi gélatineux que la substance même des nids d'hirondelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54db1d6a-b852-4df9-8fc1-15e909a7b3b8",
                                                "sense_id": "dd9f1446-96dd-3f1e-85dd-24ad02bba266",
                                                "text": "Vers le mois de mars ou d'avril, on procède au collage avec du blanc d'œuf ; cette substance a la propriété de former, avec le tannin et une partie des principes colorants, un composé gélatineux qui entraîne, en se coagulant, les matières en suspension dans le vin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "239aee92-0567-4339-a81f-bd954d3bccb7",
                                                "sense_id": "dd9f1446-96dd-3f1e-85dd-24ad02bba266",
                                                "text": "On emploie comme matière première soit les déchets de soie naturelle […], soit la substance gélatineuse contenue dans le gros intestin du ver à soie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae4ebd5-c7c5-4609-b335-fa2c7edd05be",
                                                "sense_id": "dd9f1446-96dd-3f1e-85dd-24ad02bba266",
                                                "text": "Cette révélation passa le visage de Plantin au blanc gélatineux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
